# ── Rust / Cargo ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Compiled artifacts + incremental-compilation cache (.fingerprint, deps, the
# built binaries). Regenerated by `cargo build`; never committed.
/target/
# rustfmt backups, rustc internal-compiler-error dumps, cargo-mutants output,
# and MSVC debug symbols (from GitHub's canonical Rust.gitignore).
**/*.rs.bk
rustc-ice-*.txt
**/mutants.out*/
*.pdb

# Cargo.lock IS committed on purpose: this workspace ships binaries (sag,
# sag-controller, sag-node), so we want a locked, reproducible dependency graph.

# ── Local machine config & secrets (NEVER commit) ────────────────────────────
# sag.toml is generated per-machine by setup-client.sh and names your nodes and
# endpoints — keep it local. `sag.toml.example` is the shareable template.
sag.toml
*.local.toml
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Key material / credentials.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
*_rsa
secrets/

# ── Runtime state (sqlx SQLite WAL + content-addressed artifact store) ────────
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# ── Editor / OS cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
